                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "all these positive reviews are getting out of hand! this is a tech demo and NOT a game and shouldve been released as such!\npunching has very little visual effect on the sparring partner, they dont wince when punched in the side.\nhead doesnt snap when uppercutted, or ANY visible signs of trama! youre literally punching the air! now youre doing that techincally anyway but its disturbung when i cant punch what im looking at.\nthe blocking seems non existant and i see NO indicators when or IF im blocking. this shouldve been released with an IN DEPTH TUTORIAL, animations that are akin to what youre physically doing etc.\nyou guys need to be more resposible with these reviews!!!",
